  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n Introduction \n This module provides the ability to convert any entity form into a simple multi-step form. There is no restriction on the number of steps (in terms of performance).\n\n Back to top \n\n Usage \n There is a new field group under the manage fields for any Drupal entity named Form step . It can also be configured.\n\n The next step is to add the fields, and field groups to the group step.\n\n The steps can also be sorted or disabled.\n\n Read the documentation for more information.\n\n Back to top \n\n Dependencies \n Field Group \n\n Back to top",
